  "bodyHash": "yNJInLdAjSw=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/jktGQ4XC/Lios-Outlandish-Village-Spiral-Towers.png\" alt=\"Lios-Outlandish-Village-Spiral-Towers\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>螺旋塔村莊</strong>將以高聳入雲的建築、客製化的周圍地形生成，以及層層疊疊的神秘感，徹底改變你的世界。這些垂直避難所由逃離下方危險的村民於久遠前建造，提供了庇護——卻非絕對安全。為了保護最珍貴的財物，他們在各處建造了隱藏的紅石機關。如今，秘密觸發器和隱藏密室散佈於塔樓之中，守護著稀有戰利品和被遺忘的遺物，等待勇者前來發掘。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 14px 16px; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.12); border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.03);\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/lioloader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; text-decoration: none;\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wrK85wgc/logo.png\" alt=\"LioLoader\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" style=\"display:block; border-radius: 12px;\">\n    <div style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.35;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: inherit;\">需要基於資料包的配置嗎？</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: inherit; opacity: 0.9;\">\n        試試 <strong>LioLoader</strong>，用於全域資料包/資源包載入。支援 <strong>NeoForge</strong> 和 <strong>Fabric</strong>，適用於 <strong>Minecraft 1.21.x</strong>。\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: inherit; opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 4px;\">在 Modrinth 上開啟 LioLoader →</div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9HZwsP9v/towers8.png\" alt=\"towers8\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/FqB3NwGL/towers3.png\" alt=\"towers3\" border=\"0\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9kWBQpD5/towers7.png\" alt=\"towers7\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/HT8tF2By/towers1.png\" alt=\"towers1\" border=\"0\">  <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wNyQtsW3/towers2.png\" alt=\"towers2\" border=\"0\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4w9qPp8C/towers9.png\" alt=\"towers9\" border=\"0\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/zT1pXxTy/towers4.png\" alt=\"towers4\" border=\"0\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/n2n5BVr/towers5.png\" alt=\"towers5\" border=\"0\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rGZW9xQb/towers10.png\" alt=\"towers10\" border=\"0\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4njsCD1B/towers6.png\" alt=\"towers6\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/XrhYLBjD/compatibility.png\" alt=\"compatibility\" width=\"536\" height=\"49\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>本模組不會全面改造原版村莊，因此能與任何其他村莊改造模組相容，例如 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lios-overhauled-villages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Lio's Overhauled Villages</a>！作為新系列的一部分，Lio's Outlandish Villages 旨在帶來風格獨特的城鎮和充滿冒險的建築供你探索！</em></p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/RTMvjThM/features.png\" alt=\"features\" width=\"458\" height=\"62\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>客製化戰利品表：</strong>每個寶箱都經過手動調整，提供獨特的獎勵，包含精心策劃的實用裝備、稀有發現以及符合每座塔樓主題的物品。</li>\n<li><strong>隱藏的故事：</strong>部分密室藏有村民的古老日記——這些文字記錄揭示了他們生活的片段、塔樓的歷史以及他們曾經面臨的威脅。</li>\n<li><strong>高度獨特：</strong>生成池中包含超過 40 種不同的塔樓變體，沒有任何兩座螺旋村莊會完全相同——每一座都提供全新的佈局和體驗。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/0phQs4Sb/morefromthisseries.png\" alt=\"morefromthisseries\" width=\"669\" height=\"57\" border=\"0\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hobbit-hill-village\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> <img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/NdsDc7TH/banner.png\" alt=\"banner\" width=\"345\" height=\"63\" border=\"0\"> </a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/fV6VtS4Q/youtube-reviews.png\" alt=\"youtube-reviews\" width=\"605\" height=\"44\"></p>\n<details>\n<summary>劇透警告</summary>\n<p>-評論於 11:31-<br><iframe title=\"TOP 20 NEW Minecraft Mods Of The Month! (1.21.7 to 1.20.1) | July\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/j5bxrkqWJkg?start=690\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>-評論於 7:40-<br><div style=\"left: 0; width: 100%; height: 0; position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QxYuzW_sFMg?rel=0&start=465\" style=\"top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; position: absolute; border: 0;\" allowfullscreen scrolling=\"no\" allow=\"accelerometer *; clipboard-write *; encrypted-media *; gyroscope *; picture-in-picture *; web-share *;\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"></iframe></div>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/pGkUmgGcsY\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qDNhg49/636e0a6a49cf127bf92de1e2-icon-clyde-blurple-RGB.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"97\"></a></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d;\">在模組包中使用</span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">歡迎將 <strong>螺旋塔村莊</strong> 加入任何你選擇的 Minecraft 模組包中。我們鼓勵你將這些垂直村莊建築融入自訂的模組包，打造獨特且引人入勝的冒險。無需請求許可——盡情探索並享受這些村莊塔樓吧！</p>",
